            <ArticleTitle>The Tolosa-Hunt syndrome: a problem in differential diagnosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>248-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors give a review on the Tolosa-Hunt Syndrome. They discuss its differential diagnosis, appropriate diagnostic and therapeutic measures for the evaluation of this painful ophthalmoplegia which may be combined with neurological deficit referrable to the anterior cavernous sinus.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
